# SQ program to print fibonacci sequence

GET How many fibnoacci sequence to print:

# push 0 and 1 to queue
PUSH 0
STORE
POP

PUSH 1
STORE
POP

# Start of the loop:
# Load prev next
LOAD
LOAD

STORE   # save next to queue
ADD     # next + prev
PRINT   # print

STORE   # add the (next + prev) into queue
POP

# stack now should only contain the number of values to print
# decrement the value by 1 and jump if it is greater than 0
PUSH -1
ADD
JUMPIFPOS -10 # go back to start of the loop
